      "writtenOn": "2025-05-14T14:11:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s because when com.google.common was written there was no java.util.Optional in Java yet. Actually com.google.common invented com.google.common.base.Optional and because it was good it was taken over into Java. Not sure why Enums.getIfPresent was not adapted to return java.util.Optional (probably to not break existing callers).",
