      "writtenOn": "2025-05-14T14:11:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having more than one value here happens when the admin sets multiple default values for the same config parameter, e.g. like this:\n\n```\n[repository \"*\"]\n  defaultConfig \u003d receive.rejectImplicitMerges\u003dtrue\n  defaultConfig \u003d receive.rejectImplicitMerges\u003dfalse\n```\n\nAdded a test for this.",
